{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t國家統計局公布，今年首9個月，全國房地產開發投資按年減少20.6%，再創歷來最大累計跌幅。首8個月跌幅19.9%。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n首9個月新建商品房銷售面積及銷售額，分別按年跌13.2%和13.9%。首8個月分別跌12.1%和13%。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n首9個月房地產開發企業到位資金按年跌21.6%，新開工面積減少24.9%。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：宋家樑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T02:39:04.384995+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T02:20:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T17:18:10.921775+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T02:37:34.623714+00:00","content_hash":"169d891df8a3fcde3f7e121a8c2d204046cd66a66ca4721c403d2593de235e05","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}